  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Upload a table of single-cell features, check how each column is read, then compare features across cell lines and treatments with strip and box plots, histograms with mixture-model fits, 2D scatters, dimension reduction and classifiers, and export the analysis as a standalone Python script. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
